~ start
Izzy: Hello! Hey! Hi! Cupid! So good to see you.
Cupid: Greetings heir of Philsopoll, here are the suitable flowers.

$> dialogue.start_item_requests(1)

if dialogue.all_acceptable_items():
	$> dialogue.record_tier_result(2)
	=> player_choice
elif dialogue.wrong_specific_item():
	$> dialogue.record_tier_result(1)
	Izzy: Thank you and may you have a good day! 
elif dialogue.wrong_item_type():
	$> dialogue.record_tier_result(0)
	Izzy: Ah, oh my, this is all wrong! Doom awaits me now because of you!

=> END

~ player_choice
- They are wildflowers, gathered from different regions in the kingdom.
	Cupid: They are wildflowers, gathered from different regions in the kingdom.
- They are cultivated flowers, easy to grow and nurture in your own home.
	Cupid: They are cultivated flowers, easy to grow and nurture in your own home.
- They are cultivated flowers, grown in various beautiful and vibrant colours.
	$> dialogue.increase_tier_for_correct_choice()
	Cupid: They are cultivated flowers, grown in various beautiful and vibrant colours.
Izzy: Oh my, what a sight! Thank you and may you have a good day! 